        "title": "He poubaumei apu Raguang",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He poubaumei apu Raguang,",
            "Bui khang ata gan lou tu cho?",
            "Ai !@9 na nangta kalum e,",
            "Nangta kalummei lalou o.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Ai !@9 kalummei mu nicho?",
            "Lalou o ai !@9 kalummei;",
            "Baimei ta ai kalum makge,",
            "Njian thaimei nangta ram mak.",
            "",
            "2. Joukhiang !@9na ariu ngam mak,",
            "Bui !@9 biumei ndun ngam mak;",
            "Kross khou kajei hang tei luang kei,",
            "Hei tei !@9 anuan khiu than lou.",
            "",
            "3. Arimathia khou kaipou pu,",
            "Raguang ta nkhuan bammei e;",
            "Pilat hukhou ping mak nga guang,",
            "Poubaumei pum tei guang nei",
            "",
            "4. Jao khang tatmei kapui pam tei,",
            "Ringthao dat kanmei ta houna;",
            "Jingbang le kalan kathum khou,",
            "Thao kan the tuna salou e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
